'''Captain Silas''' is a [[human]] [[quest giver]] located in the [[Remnants Camp]] in [[Tirisfal Glades]]. A survivor of Grand Marshal [[Othmar Garithos]]' forces,<ref>[https://discord.com/channels/466622455805378571/528228771594240030/1090029823910477845 Gheor from the Turtle WoW Community Discord] - "The Tirisfal Uplands humans are what's left of his army."</ref> he leads the [[Alliance Remnants]] in the [[Tirisfal Uplands]] and seeks to restore communications with the Alliance to get support to the Remnants. [[Duchess Grelda]] wants him killed.

